<title>UK: Silvermines appoints new finance director.</title>
<headline>Silvermines appoints new finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silvermines Group Plc said it had appointed Piero Fileccia as group finance director effective from October 7.</p>
<p>It said Fileccia was previously at Salem Engineering Company Limited, a subsidiary of Salem Corporation, as group finance director.  </p>
<p>Fileccia takes over from Lloyd Trinkoff who resigned with effect from September 30.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
